                <pb facs="0758" n="654" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg654"/>

                <head>Chapter VIII: April 1–May 5, 1932</head>
                <p>Further American Consultations on Behalf of Nine-Power Treaty of 1922;
                    Restatement of United States Policy Respecting Disposal of Arms to China, April
                    5; American Suggestions Regarding Solution of Manchurian Problem, April 12 (and
                    22); American Avoidance of Part in Chinese Military Training, April 19;
                    Consultations of Secretary Stimson at
                    Geneva Respecting Impasse in Shanghai Armistice Negotiations and Situation in
                    Manchuria; Resolution of League Assembly Respecting Conclusion of Shanghai
                    Armistice, April 30; Signature of Shanghai Armistice Agreement and Constitution
                    of Joint Commission Thereunder, May 5</p>
























































































































